KlNQn8dhQG90qdnAsgQ&oe=6ADCB7BF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Frame 8-2.png", "id": "1288445690012829", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821682_1288445696679495_3924196130298723705_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=C9ZAxXrTJDYQ7kNvwH9zrK5&_nc_oc=Adr81k8ekFT5An5D3_rNZDDdTYJ4X9JUsVlYWAVyXe8Oywn4CvOAlbhJ3a0uAKyRDQ0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPJ5qX-n9UmfaRWY8uxKaCGQM6ybq_akxZRhR33fYNJyQ&oe=6ADCC3D2"}, "display_name": "SkyLeap", "keywords": ["parkour", "climbing", "action", "platformer", "shooter"], "long_description": "SkyLeap is a non-stop VR parkour action game where your only goal is to climb higher and higher. Use jumps, a grappling hook, and telekinesis to flow through a vertical world built for speed and movement.\n\n{1813006879397225}\n\nRun, climb, and fight:\n\n\u26a1 Dodge turrets and tricky obstacles\n\n\ud83d\udd2b Use your weapons mid-air\n\n\ud83c\udf00 Chain jumps and telekinesis into fluid combos\n\n\u2b06\ufe0f Keep climbing and push your limits\n\n{792032636563437}\n\nOnly speed, reflexes, and the flow of movement will keep you in the race.\n\n{1516906566071378}\n\nUpgrades, customization, and an energetic soundtrack await.\n\n{836591216091404}\n\nAre you ready to make your leap into the sky?\n\n\n\n\n", "short_description": "SkyLeap is a non-stop VR parkour action game where your only goal is to climb higher and higher. Use jumps, a grappling hook, and telekinesis to move through a dynamic vertical world designed to keep your momentum flowing."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.xocus.co/privacy-policy-eng", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "XOCUS", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.xocus.co/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES